# PC card team-concord (TMODE-33 CONCORD, BENCH-150): arm cn (the team brain forced on for every team; the named teams play it on top of their entry), all 46 teams, 12 seeds from 6700, against master (the aa build). Template: ccprep writes work/team-concord-cn.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
12
--seed-base
6700
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@cn.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@cn
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-concord-@V@-cn
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-concord-cn.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
